tion\": \"A televised football match in England stopped dead last night because of something hanging over the stadium. Fleetwood vs Arsenal, October 27, 9:05 PM, and the referee holds up the game while players from both teams stand on the pitch staring straight up at the sky. This is live broadcast footage, CBS Sports cameras, not a shaky phone video from somebody's backyard. You can see the ref pointing up at it, talking to officials on the touchline, waiting for somebody to tell him what to do. The commentators call it a drone because they have to call it something. Nobody on that field knew what it was, and the match sat frozen for minutes while it drifted over the ground. The comparison everybody's making is New Jersey, 2024. Same kind of object, same slow drift over a populated area, same total absence of an official answer while it's happening. The New Jersey wave went on for weeks and ended with the government basically shrugging on camera. Two years later it's happening over a stadium full of people on live television, and the response is identical. Stop the event, watch it, wait for it to leave on its own. #ufocommunity #ufology #ufos #uaptiktok #ufosightings\",\n        \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-28T12:09:39.000Z\",\n        \"url\": \"https://www.tiktok.com/@ganymede.station/video/7701689672254197022\",\n        \"thumbnailUrl\": \"https://p16-common-sign.tiktokcdn-us.com/tos-useast8-p-0068-tx2/ogsDfWAwfAISfv3uBDjVkAC4zEIqFIy368TQD9~tplv-tiktokx-cropcenter:500:800.jpeg?biz_tag=musically_video.video_cover&dr=9638&idc=useast8&ps=13740610&refresh_token=34032c4e&shcp=9b759fb9&shp=c1333099&t=4d5b0474&x-expires=1794006000&x-signature=l5DnSUJH9EIuzi%2BL6mhwDW8lNBo%3D\",\n        \"durationMs\": 62635,\n        \"pinned\": false,\n        \"isAd\": false,\n        \"stats\": {\n          \"views\": 1571243,\n          \"likes\": 33351,\n          \"comments\": 673,\n          \"shares\": 7134,\n          \"saves\": 5488\n        },\n        \"media\": {\n          